dsh-alioth is an independent, native consumer of the Alioth model. It is
NOT a consumer of any upstream application's products; it never writes
back to a model authority.

## Frozen model artifacts (Apache-2.0, historical AppCreator distribution)

This repository vendors the published Alioth v10.x consumption-side
artifacts under packages/alioth/env-alioth/vendor/:

- the isahl_meta registry bootstrap baseline (`backend/ddl/*isahl_meta*.sql`)
- the skill-adapter definitions (`skill-adapters/*.yaml`)
- the prototype build scripts (`scripts/prototype-tool.js`, its check/eval
  companions)

These files are redistributed from the historical AppCreator open
distribution — Copyright 2026 The Alioth Authors, Licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 — which has since been removed from upstream.
They remain under Apache-2.0; the model evolves only through new plugin
releases that refresh these artifacts.

Not vendored: the shell reference assets (`gateway-shell.tsx`,
`prototype-base.css`, UMD vendors) existed only in the closed-source
upstream and are replaced by in-repo equivalents (planned).

## Semantic-mapping library (generated, shipped with the plugin)

packages/alioth/skill-alioth/src/data/{coordinates,physical-tables,fk-index}.json
are generated offline by scripts/generate-semantic-dicts.ts from:

- the Alioth model repository (github.com/CosmicTools9/Alioth) — MIT
  License, Copyright (c) 2025 宇器科技 — dimension seeds
  (003_seed_dimensions.sql) and tables DDL (002_isahl_tables.sql)
- the vendored isahl_meta seed (Apache-2.0, The Alioth Authors) for the
  FK index

The library ships with the plugin; no database access is required to
rebuild it.

